-- edit rows there, not in this file or in the frontend.
--
-- Cleaning applied while generating (source cells unchanged):
--   * mojibake (UTF-8 read as cp1252, e.g. 'â€“' → '–') in 9 citation cells
--   * markdown-wrapped URLs '[https://x](https://x)' → 'https://x' (4 rows)
